<!--
Which REST security domain each screen drives.

Keyed on widgetName rather than on the menu item: the same widget is the same
screen in every one of the app menus, so one row here secures it everywhere and
a new vertical reusing the widget inherits it. A MenuItem may still override
this with its own artifactGroupId.

check#RestAccess turns this into authorization: a group reaches a domain only
when the organization's menu shows it a screen that drives that domain.
-->
